인근에 위치한 어린이집, 문덕초, 문현중,고(스쿨버스 운영함)\n\n항상 최선을 다하는 민부동산입니다.\n\n[phone removed]..........[phone removed] \n","addr":"서울시 송파구 송파대로 111","jibun":"서울시 송파구 문정동 618","lat":37.480506,"lng":127.123239,"imgs":["https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/710429dc-ee9d-4336-b1c7-57d96419520c","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/78a91cc3-dd65-4d83-862b-e39ef0f0e9ac","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/110bbe1a-ffbe-48b8-9813-4d6b4eb27378","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/17399c24-be62-4435-9669-f0fa9e988139","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/c83e3561-861f-4561-8c36-fd63df27dfc9","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/3bb43194-45e0-4b45-8a81-0bea27709f00","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/35b55dcd-9421-4f58-a81d-e60e339d0b27","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/fb2b3941-ad24-4cdf-90bc-22eb93e8f513","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/fe7f45cd-60d4-4f19-af5c-f53c085787aa","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/949b0bac-fd9d-4d1f-bb17-3f787ba08299","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/5464f918-d920-4a22-8221-7cf4bd0a3a0c","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/5dfe1933-277f-4b85-8d27-9177dd12c739","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/4097832e-ae89-47ff-9742-a43c63a5c1c6","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/9b7cfee9-2b28-40b3-a743-d7542580b35e","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/489bea00-d9f0-4e52-b332-41b129fe4e9f","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/bd6de7d7-56fd-4c8f-8d41-cca9e024a4e0","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/a4b8b089-6da6-4566-b5fa-1f8bc2e6ffb9"],"facts":[["Exclusive size","84.99 m²"],["Supply size","116.38 m²"],["Rooms",3],["Bathrooms",2],["Floor","고층 of 19층"],["Facing","남동"],["Layout","복합식"],["Parking","가능, 4 per unit"],["Move in","2027.02.28"],["Maintenance","28만원"],["Approved","2016.09.29"],["Households",999],["Posted","2026.10.29"]],"opts":["스탠드형","옷장","신발장","샤워부스","욕조","비데","싱크대","가스레인지","가스오븐","붙박이장","화재경보기","베란다","무인택배함"],"tags":["주차","보